[4.189, "o", "\r\n✓ orch project initialized at /tmp/demo/billing-api\r\n✓ model_router.yaml: added 1 route(s) for the template's tasks — claude/claude-sonnet-4-6\r\n  (tier defaults to `standard`; review it, it drives the budget gate)\r\n· models: agy lists 13 models\r\n· models:   listed but not routed: gemini-4-argon-medium, gemini-4-argon-low, gemini-3.8-flash-high, gemini-3.8-flash-low, claude-opus-5-5-low, claude-opus-5-5-medium, claude-opus-5-5-high, claude-sonnet-5-5-low, claude-sonnet-5-5-medium, claude-sonnet-5-5-high, gpt-oss-120b-medium\r\n\r\n"]
[4.19, "o", "First: each task works on its own git branch, and this is not a git repository yet: git init && git add -A && git commit -m \"orch init\"\r\n\r\nNext: run the tasks it came with (`orch tasks --project-root /tmp/demo/billing-api` lists them):\r\n    orch run --project-root /tmp/demo/billing-api\r\n\r\nPlan what you want to build:\r\n    orch start \"<what you want to build>\"\r\n\r\nConfig: /tmp/demo/billing-api/.orchestrator/config.yaml\r\n"]
[4.19, "o", "  One file. `budgets.yaml` and `dashboard.yaml` are optional overrides\r\n  that deep-merge on top if you drop them in the project root.\r\n"]
[4.19, "o", "\r\nreport_findings is on: agents may file public issues about orch with your gh login.\r\n  Turn it off with report_findings.enabled: false in .orchestrator/config.yaml.\r\n"]
[4.194, "o", "\r\nClaude agents are refused orch's own tools until the project allows them.\r\nThese rules would be added to permissions.allow in /tmp/demo/billing-api/.claude/settings.json:\r\n  mcp__orch\r\n"]
[4.194, "o", "  Bash(scripts/task-finish.sh:*)\r\n  Bash(scripts/task-block.sh:*)\r\n"]
[4.194, "o", "Added mcp__orch, Bash(scripts/task-finish.sh:*), Bash(scripts/task-block.sh:*) to /tmp/demo/billing-api/.claude/settings.json.\r\n"]
